OL,3,GNEWSATeenager arrested after cyclist
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl has been arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal collision between a
OL,8,Fcar and a cyclist on Friday night.
OL,10,FThe crash occurred at around 22:15 BST
OL,11,Fon the A4440 Swinesherd Way in
OL,12,FWorcester, involving a white Suzuki
OL,13,FSwift and a man on a pedal cycle.
OL,15,FA man in his 60s, who was the cyclist,
OL,16,Fsustained serious injuries and was
OL,17,Fconfirmed dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
