OL,3,GNEWSATeenager arrested after cyclist
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the car, a 17-year-old
OL,7,Fgirl, was arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fcausing death by careless driving is
OL,9,Fcurrently helping police with
OL,10,Finquiries, West Mercia Police said.
